Changes in version 0.93 demo
I added and enabled Steam achievements;

Now, when starting a new game, your Steam name is automatically added - you can change this;

The previous test achievements are outdated;

You can now also see the weather on the terminals - in the full version it will be expanded with many other functions, including a weather forecast, although a rather simplified one will be available in a demo in the next improvements.

There will be another patch with fixes coming soon, but at the request of a few people, for now I've focused only on adding Steam achievements.
 [img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44720610/047fda29306d506392cde919d72322f7c49eee23.png"]About achievements in the demo and other similar features:
There will be many more and different ones in the full version;

Trading cards will be added to the full version – Steam prevents them from being added in the demo;

Statistics and leaderboards will be added to the demo soon;

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44720610/6d9ebe7d3d98d58c61383733771a1f03e7972f9f.png"]

Best regards, author
